# Model policy

Say the choice out loud before a long run.

- A clear edit that `npm test` can prove: Composer 2.5.
- An audit, a plan, or an incident where the right fix is not obvious: Grok 4.7. Use one third-party frontier model only when you write down why.
- Subagents stay on the parent model unless their file names one. Do not pin a frontier model on a subagent by default.
- One task, one branch. Do not start a second implementation of work another agent already owns.
